<title>JAPAN: Yamatane Corp files 20 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Yamatane Corp files 20 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warehouse operator Yamatane Corp said on Tuesday that it had applied the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 20 billion yen of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration would be effective for two years from February 1, it said.</p>
